@yogadirect.com</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div><h4>Shop</h4><p><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; bricks</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><br><a href='/shop.html#kits'>Kits &amp; bundles</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Business</h4><p><a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio fit-outs</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Logo printing</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Net-30</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Help</h4><p><a href='/contact.html'>Contact us</a><br><a href='/contact.html#shipping'>Shipping info</a><br><a href='/contact.html#returns'>60-day returns</a><br><a href='/index.html#bulk'>Request a quote</a></p></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Shop Pay</span></div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div class='stickycta'><a class='btn' href='#mats'>Shop mats</a><a class='btn gh' href='/wholesale.html'>Bulk quote</a></div>\\n\\n<div class='scrim' id='scrim' onclick='closeCart()'></div>\\n<aside class='drawer' id='drawer'>\\n  <div class='dhead'><span>Your cart</span><button class='close' onclick='closeCart()'>×</button></div>\\n  <div class='dbody'><div class='ship' id='ship'></div><div id='items'></div><p id='empty' class='microcopy'>Your cart is empty — start with our best-selling <a href='#mats' onclick='closeCart()' style='color:var(--accent);font-weight:700'>Deluxe mat</a>.</p></div>\\n  <div class='dfoot'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:12px'><span style='font-weight:700'>Subtotal</span><span class='price' id='subtotal'>$0.00</span></div><button class='btn full' onclick='checkout()'>Secure checkout →</button><p class='microcopy center'>🔒 SSL encrypted · 60-day returns · Ships today</p></div>\\n</aside>\\n<div class='toast' id='toast'></div>\\n<script>\\nvar FREE=75;var cart=[];try{cart=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(\\\"ydcart\\\")||\\\"[]\\\")}catch(e){cart=[]}\\nfunction save(){try{localStorage.setItem(\\\"ydcart\\\",JSON.stringify(cart))}catch(e){}render()}\\nfunction add(n,p){cart.push({n:n,p:p});save();toast(n+\\\" added to cart\\\");openCart()}\\nfunction rm(i){cart.splice(i,1);save()}\\nfunction render(){var t=0,h=\\\"\\\";for(var i=0;i<cart.length;i++){t+=cart[i].p;h+=\\\"<div class='li'><span>\\\"+cart[i].n+\\\"<br><button onclick='rm(\\\"+i+\\\")'>Remove</button></span><b>$\\\"+cart[i].p.toFixed(2)+\\\"</b></div>\\\"}\\nvar it=document.getElementById(\\\"items\\\");if(it)it.innerHTML=h;var em=document.getElementById(\\\"empty\\\");if(em)em.style.display=cart.length?\\\"none\\\":\\\"block\\\";var st=document.getElementById(\\\"subtotal\\\");if(st)st.textContent=\\\"$\\\"+t.toFixed(2);var cb=document.getElementById(\\\"cbadge\\\");if(cb)cb.textContent=cart.length;var s=document.getElementById(\\\"ship\\\");if(s){var pct=Math.min(100,t/FREE*100);s.innerHTML=(t>=FREE?\\\"🎉 You've unlocked FREE shipping!\\\":\\\"Add $\\\"+(FREE-t).toFixed(2)+\\\" more for FREE shipping\\\")+\\\"<span class='pbar'><i style='width:\\\"+pct+\\\"%'></i></span>\\\"}}\\nfunction openCart(){document.getElementById(\\\"drawer\\\").classList.add(\\\"open\\\");document.getElementById(\\\"scrim\\\").classList.add(\\\"open\\\")}\\nfunction closeCart(){document.getElementById(\\\"drawer\\\").classList.remove(\\\"open\\\");document.getElementById(\\\"scrim\\\").classList.remove(\\\"open\\\")}\\nfunction checkout(){if(!cart.length){toast(\\\"Add an item first 🙂\\\");return}toast(\\\"Taking you to secure checkout…\\\")}\\nvar tt;function toast(m){var e=document.getElementById(\\\"toast\\\");e.textContent=m;e.classList.add(\\\"on\\\");clearTimeout(tt);tt=setTimeout(function(){e.classList.remove(\\\"on\\\")},2600)}\\nrender();\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"},{\"path\":\"/wholesale.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n<meta charset='utf-8'>\\n<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1'>\\n<title>Wholesale &amp; Bulk Yoga Mats for Studios, Schools &amp; Events | YogaDirect</title>\\n<meta name='description' content='Bulk yoga mats and props at up to 40% off. Free logo printing on 50+ mats, Net-30 for schools, quotes in one business hour. Trusted by 12,000+ studios since 1999.'>\\n<style>\\n:root{--ink:#20272e;--plum:#33223a;--teal:#0f6b6b;--sand:#faf6f0;--accent:#e2622f;--accent-d:#c4501f;--line:#e8dfd3;--muted:#6b6257}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.55}\\na{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\\n.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}\\n.bar{background:var(--plum);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 14px}\\n.bar b{color:#ffd7a8}\\nheader.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}\\n.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 0}\\n.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:var(--teal);white-space:nowrap}\\n.logo span{color:var(--accent)}\\nnav.main{display:flex;gap:20px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;flex:1}\\nnav.main a:hover{color:var(--accent)}\\n.hact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n.phone{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;line-height:1.25}\\n.phone b{display:block;color:var(--teal);font-size:15px}\\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:9px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;text-align:center;transition:.15s;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(226,98,47,.25)}\\n.btn:hover{background:var(--accent-d)}\\n.btn.gh{background:#fff;color:var(--plum);border:2px solid var(--plum);box-shadow:none}\\n.btn.gh:hover{background:var(--plum);color:#fff}\\n.btn.full{display:block;width:100%}\\nh1{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-1.3px;line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 12px}\\nh2{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:0 0 8px}\\nh3{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 6px}\\n.lead{font-size:17.5px;color:var(--muted);max-width:58ch}\\n.sec{padding:52px 0}\\n.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}\\n.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 6px}\\n.hero{background:linear-gradient(150deg,#33223a,#123f43);color:#fff;padding:8px 0 0}\\n.hero .lead{color:#d9d1c6}\\n.hgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:40px;align-items:start;padding:44px 0}\\n.ulist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 24px}\\n.ulist li{padding:6px 0 6px 30px;position:relative;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600}\\n.ulist li:before{content:'✓';position:absolute;left:0;top:6px;background:#ffb37a;color:#33223a;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800}\\n.form{background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:26px;color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 20px 44px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}\\n.form label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 5px}\\n.form input,.form select,.form textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #d8cfc2;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fdfcfa}\\n.form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}.form .row>*{flex:1}\\n.microcopy{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.center{text-align:center}\\n.tier{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15.5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n.tier th,.tier td{padding:13px 15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left}\\n.tier th{background:var(--plum);color:#fff;font-size:13px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px}\\n.tier tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}\\n.tier td b{color:#116b4e}\\n.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}\\n.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}\\n.box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}\\n.quote{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);border-radius:12px;padding:20px}\\n.rate{color:#e6a417;font-weight:700;margin:0}\\n.who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}\\n.step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px}\\n.step b.num{display:inline-flex;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px}\\ndetails{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px}\\ndetails summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\ndetails p{color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0}\\nfooter.site{background:var(--plum);color:#cfc6bd;padding:44px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}\\nfooter.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}\\nfooter.site a:hover{color:#fff}\\n.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}\\n.fbot{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);margin-top:26px;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.stickycta{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 12px;display:none;gap:10px;z-index:70;box-shadow:0 -6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\\n.stickycta .btn{flex:1;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px}\\n@media(max-width:960px){nav.main{display:none}.hgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;padding:30px 0}h1{font-size:31px}.grid3,.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.phone{display:none}.stickycta{display:flex}body{padding-bottom:66px}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class='bar'>🏷️ <b>Bulk pricing from 10 units — up to 40% off</b> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Free logo printing on 50+ mats &nbsp;·&nbsp; Quotes in 1 business hour</div>\\n<header class='site'>\\n  <div class='wrap hrow'>\\n    <a href='/index.html' class='logo'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <nav class='main'>\\n      <a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a>\\n      <a href='/shop.html#kits'>Studio Kits</a>\\n      <a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a>\\n      <a href='/contact.html'>Help</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class='hact'>\\n      <div class='phone'>Bulk team direct<b>1-800-555-9642</b></div>\\n      <a class='btn' style='padding:11px 16px;font-size:14px' href='#quote'>Get a quote</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class='hero'>\\n  <div class='wrap hgrid'>\\n    <div>\\n      <p class='eyebrow' style='color:#ffb37a'>Wholesale &amp; bulk since 1999</p>\\n      <h1>Outfit your studio, school or event for up to 40% less.</h1>\\n      <p class='lead'>We manufacture and source our own mats and props, so you buy at the source. 12,000+ studios, retreats, hotels, gyms and school districts already do.</p>\\n      <ul class='ulist'>\\n        <li>Tiered pricing starting at just 10 units</li>\\n        <li>Free logo printing on orders of 50+ mats</li>\\n        <li>Net-30 terms &amp; PO acceptance for schools</li>\\n        <li>Dedicated account manager + easy reorders</li>\\n        <li>Freight quoted upfront — no surprise costs</li>\\n      </ul>\\n      <p style='color:#ffd7a8;font-weight:700;margin:0'>⏱ Average quote turnaround today: 38 minutes.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='form' id='quote'>\\n      <h3>Request your custom quote</h3>\\n      <p class='microcopy' style='margin:0'>Free, no obligation. A real account manager replies — usually within the hour.</p>\\n      <form onsubmit='return leadSent(this)'>\\n        <div class='row'><div><label>Name *</label><input required placeholder='Jane Patel'></div><div><label>Business / organization</label><input placeholder='Lotus Yoga Co.'></div></div>\\n        <div class='row'><div><label>Email *</label><input type='email' required placeholder='jane@studio.com'></div><div><label>Phone</label><input placeholder='(555) 012-3456'></div></div>\\n        <label>Organization type</label>\\n        <select><option>Yoga studio</option><option>Gym / fitness center</option><option>School or university</option><option>Hotel / resort / retreat</option><option>Corporate wellness</option><option>Event or festival</option><option>Reseller / distributor</option></select>\\n        <div class='row'><div><label>Approx. quantity</label><select><option>10–49 units</option><option>50–199 units</option><option>200–499 units</option><option>500+ units</option></select></div><div><label>Needed by</label><input placeholder='e.g. Nov 12'></div></div>\\n        <label>What do you need? (products, colors, logo)</label>\\n        <textarea rows='3' placeholder='30 purple 1/4\\\" mats + 40 foam blocks, logo printed'></textarea>\\n        <button class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send my quote request →</button>\\n        <p class='microcopy center'>We never share your details. Or call <b>1-800-555-9642</b>, Mon–Fri 9–6 ET.</p>\\n      </form>\\n      <div id='leadok' style='display:none;text-align:center;padding:26px 0'>\\n        <h3>✅ Got it — your quote is on the way</h3>\\n        <p class='microcopy'>You'll receive pricing, freight cost and lead times by email shortly. Need it urgently? Call 1-800-555-9642 and mention your request.</p>\\n        <a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Browse the catalog meanwhile</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class='sec'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='center'><p class='eyebrow'>Transparent pricing</p><h2>Volume pricing you can plan a budget around</h2><p class='lead' style='margin:0 auto 22px'>Example: our best-selling Deluxe 1/4\\\" mat. Every product in the catalog has a comparable tier structure.</p></div>\\n    <table class='tier'>\\n      <tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price per mat</th><th>You save</th><th>Extras included</th></tr>\\n      <tr><td>1–9</td><td>$21.99</td><td>—</td><td>Free shipping over $75</td></tr>\\n      <tr><td>10–49</td><td><b>$14.75</b></td><td><b>33% off</b></td><td>Free shipping · mixed colors OK</td></tr>\\n      <tr><td>50–199</td><td><b>$12.90</b></td><td><b>41% off</b></td><td>Free logo printing · account manager</td></tr>\\n      <tr><td>200+</td><td><b>Custom</b></td><td><b>Best price</b></td><td>Freight, Net-30 &amp; scheduled delivery</td></tr>\\n    </table>\\n    <p class='center' style='margin-top:24px'><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Get my exact pricing →</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class='sec alt'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='center'><p class='eyebrow'>Simple process</p><h2>From request to delivery in days, not weeks</h2></div>\\n    <div class='grid4' style='margin-top:24px'>\\n      <div class='step'><b class='num'>1</b><h3>Tell us what you need</h3><p class='microcopy'>One short form or a 5-minute call. No account setup required.</p></div>\\n      <div class='step'><b class='num'>2</b><h3>Get pricing in ~1 hour</h3><p class='microcopy'>Itemized quote with freight, lead time and color availability.</p></div>\\n      <div class='step'><b class='num'>3</b><h3>Approve &amp; (optionally) proof your logo</h3><p class='microcopy'>Digital proof within 24 hours on branded orders.</p></div>\\n      <div class='step'><b class='num'>4</b><h3>Ships in 1–3 days</h3><p class='microcopy'>Tracked delivery from our Ohio warehouse, with reorder history saved.</p></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class='sec'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='center'><p class='eyebrow'>Proof</p><h2>Studios that stopped overpaying</h2></div>\\n    <div class='grid3' style='margin-top:22px'>\\n      <div class='quote'><p class='rate'>★★★★★</p><p>\\\"We replaced 40 mats for less than we used to spend on 15 — and two years later they still look new.\\\"</p><p class='who'>— Marisa T., studio owner, Austin TX</p></div>\\n      <div class='quote'><p class='rate'>★★★★★</p><p>\\\"Quote in 30 minutes, mats printed with our logo, delivered before our 60-person retreat. Flawless.\\\"</p><p class='who'>— Devon R., retreat organizer, Asheville NC</p></div>\\n      <div class='quote'><p class='rate'>★★★★★</p><p>\\\"They accept our district POs and Net-30, which almost no one else does. Props survive teenagers.\\\"</p><p class='who'>— Karen L., PE teacher, Columbus OH</p></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='box center' style='margin-top:26px'><b>Trusted by:</b> boutique studios · YMCA branches · public school districts · hotels &amp; resorts · corporate wellness programs · yoga festivals</div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class='sec alt'>\\n  <div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'>\\n    <div class='center'><p class='eyebrow'>Wholesale FAQ</p><h2>Everything buyers ask us</h2></div>\\n    <div style='margin-top:20px'>\\n      <details open><summary>What is the minimum order?</summary><p>Bulk pricing begins at 10 units of a product. There's no minimum to order from the regular catalog.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>Can I mix colors and products?</summary><p>Yes. Quantity tiers are based on total units of a product line, so you can mix colors freely, and we can combine props into a single quote and shipment.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>Do you offer payment terms?</summary><p>Net-30 terms and purchase orders are available for schools, universities, municipalities and established businesses. Just note it in your request.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>How does logo printing work?</summary><p>Free on orders of 50+ mats. Send artwork (vector preferred) with your request; we email a digital proof within 24 hours and print after your approval. Adds 3–5 business days.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>What about freight and delivery timelines?</summary><p>Freight is quoted upfront and included in your written quote — no surprises. Most bulk orders ship within 1–3 business days of approval.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>What if something arrives damaged?</summary><p>Send a photo and we replace it, no return shipping required. Our 60-day satisfaction guarantee applies to bulk orders too.</p></details>\\n    </div>\\n    <p class='center' style='margin-top:26px'><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Request my bulk quote</a> &nbsp; <a class='btn gh' href='/contact.html'>Talk to a human</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class='site'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='fgrid'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div>\\n        <p>Supplying the yoga community with mats, props and studio equipment direct from the source since 1999.</p>\\n        <p><b style='color:#fff'>1-800-555-9642</b><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET<br>wholesale@yogadirect.com</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div><h4>Shop</h4><p><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; bricks</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><br><a href='/shop.html#kits'>Kits &amp; bundles</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Business</h4><p><a href='/wholesale.html#quote'>Request a quote</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio fit-outs</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Logo printing</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Net-30</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Help</h4><p><a href='/contact.html'>Contact us</a><br><a href='/contact.html#shipping'>Shipping info</a><br><a href='/contact.html#returns'>60-day returns</a></p></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Net-30</span></div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n<div class='stickycta'><a class='btn' href='#quote'>Get my bulk quote</a><a class='btn gh' href='tel:18005559642'>Call now</a></div>\\n<script>\\nfunction leadSent(f){f.style.display=\\\"none\\\";document.getElementById(\\\"leadok\\\").style.display=\\\"block\\\";return false}\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"},{\"path\":\"/contact.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang='en'>\\n<head>\\n<meta charset='utf-8'>\\n<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1'>\\n<title>Contact, Shipping &amp; Returns | YogaDirect Customer Care</title>\\n<meta name='description' content='Talk to a real person at YogaDirect: 1-800-555-9642, Mon–Fri 9–6 ET. Free shipping over $75, same-day dispatch before 2pm ET, 60-day free returns.'>\\n<style>\\n:root{--ink:#20272e;--plum:#33223a;--teal:#0f6b6b;--sand:#faf6f0;--accent:#e2622f;--accent-d:#c4501f;--line:#e8dfd3;--muted:#6b6257}\\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}\\nbody{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;line-height:1.55}\\na{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\\n.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}\\n.bar{background:var(--plum);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 14px}\\n.bar b{color:#ffd7a8}\\nheader.site{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.05)}\\n.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:12px 0}\\n.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px;color:var(--teal);white-space:nowrap}\\n.logo span{color:var(--accent)}\\nnav.main{display:flex;gap:20px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;flex:1}\\nnav.main a:hover{color:var(--accent)}\\n.phone{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;line-height:1.25}\\n.phone b{display:block;color:var(--teal);font-size:15px}\\n.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 26px;border-radius:9px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(226,98,47,.25)}\\n.btn:hover{background:var(--accent-d)}\\n.btn.gh{background:#fff;color:var(--plum);border:2px solid var(--plum);box-shadow:none}\\n.btn.gh:hover{background:var(--plum);color:#fff}\\n.btn.full{display:block;width:100%}\\nh1{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-1.1px;margin:0 0 10px}\\nh2{font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.6px;margin:0 0 8px}\\nh3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px}\\n.lead{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch}\\n.sec{padding:46px 0}\\n.sec.alt{background:var(--sand)}\\n.eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 6px}\\n.head{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#fdf8f2,#eef3f1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:36px 0}\\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:start}\\n.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}\\n.box{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:22px}\\n.box b.big{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--teal)}\\n.form{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(51,34,58,.08)}\\n.form label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 5px}\\n.form input,.form select,.form textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 13px;border:1px solid #d8cfc2;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fdfcfa}\\n.form .row{display:flex;gap:12px}.form .row>*{flex:1}\\n.microcopy{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n.center{text-align:center}\\ndetails{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px}\\ndetails summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\ndetails p{color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0 0}\\nfooter.site{background:var(--plum);color:#cfc6bd;padding:44px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}\\nfooter.site h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px}\\nfooter.site a:hover{color:#fff}\\n.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}\\n.fbot{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);margin-top:26px;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n.stickycta{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 12px;display:none;gap:10px;z-index:70;box-shadow:0 -6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}\\n.stickycta .btn{flex:1;padding:13px 10px;font-size:15px}\\n@media(max-width:960px){nav.main{display:none}.grid2,.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.phone{display:none}h1{font-size:29px}.stickycta{display:flex}body{padding-bottom:66px}}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n<div class='bar'>💬 <b>Real humans, no bots</b> · 1-800-555-9642, Mon–Fri 9am–6pm ET · Average email reply: under 2 hours</div>\\n<header class='site'>\\n  <div class='wrap hrow'>\\n    <a href='/index.html' class='logo'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <nav class='main'>\\n      <a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a>\\n      <a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a>\\n      <a href='/shop.html#kits'>Studio Kits</a>\\n      <a href='/wholesale.html'>Wholesale &amp; Bulk</a>\\n      <a href='/contact.html'>Help</a>\\n    </nav>\\n    <div class='phone'>Talk to a real yogi<b>1-800-555-9642</b></div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<div class='head'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <p class='eyebrow'>We're here to help</p>\\n    <h1>Questions before you order? Ask away.</h1>\\n    <p class='lead'>Whether you need help picking the right mat thickness or pricing for 300 units, a member of our team in Ohio will get back to you fast.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class='sec'>\\n  <div class='wrap grid3'>\\n    <div class='box'><h3>📞 Call us</h3><b class='big'>1-800-555-9642</b><p class='microcopy'>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET. Average hold time under 60 seconds.</p></div>\\n    <div class='box'><h3>✉️ Email us</h3><b class='big'>help@yogadirect.com</b><p class='microcopy'>Replies in under 2 hours during business hours. Bulk buyers: wholesale@yogadirect.com</p></div>\\n    <div class='box'><h3>🏷️ Need bulk pricing?</h3><b class='big'>Quote in ~1 hour</b><p class='microcopy'>Up to 40% off from 10 units. <a href='/wholesale.html#quote' style='color:var(--accent);font-weight:700'>Request a quote →</a></p></div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class='sec alt'>\\n  <div class='wrap grid2'>\\n    <div class='form'>\\n      <h2>Send us a message</h2>\\n      <p class='microcopy' style='margin:0'>We answer every message — usually within 2 business hours.</p>\\n      <form onsubmit='return sent(this)'>\\n        <div class='row'><div><label>Name *</label><input required placeholder='Jane Patel'></div><div><label>Email *</label><input type='email' required placeholder='jane@email.com'></div></div>\\n        <label>How can we help?</label>\\n        <select><option>Product question / help choosing</option><option>Order status or tracking</option><option>Return or exchange</option><option>Bulk / wholesale pricing</option><option>Logo printing</option><option>Something else</option></select>\\n        <label>Message</label>\\n        <textarea rows='4' placeholder='Which mat thickness do you recommend for hot yoga?'></textarea>\\n        <button class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send message →</button>\\n        <p class='microcopy center'>Prefer to talk? Call 1-800-555-9642.</p>\\n      </form>\\n      <div id='ok' style='display:none;text-align:center;padding:24px 0'>\\n        <h3>✅ Message sent</h3>\\n        <p class='microcopy'>Thanks! We'll reply by email shortly. In the meantime, browse our best sellers.</p>\\n        <a class='btn' href='/shop.html'>Shop best sellers</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h2 id='shipping'>Shipping</h2>\\n      <div style='margin-bottom:22px'>\\n        <details open><summary>How much is shipping?</summary><p>Free standard shipping on US orders over $75. Below $75, flat-rate shipping starts at $6.95. Bulk freight is always quoted upfront.</p></details>\\n        <details><summary>When will my order ship?</summary><p>Same business day for orders placed before 2pm ET from our Ohio warehouse. Delivery is typically 2–5 business days in the continental US.</p></details>\\n        <details><summary>Do you ship internationally?</summary><p>Yes — to Canada and select international destinations. Rates are calculated at checkout, or contact us for a freight quote on large orders.</p></details>\\n      </div>\\n      <h2 id='returns'>Returns &amp; guarantee</h2>\\n      <details open><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>Return any unused item within 60 days for a full refund or exchange — no restocking fees. Just email help@yogadirect.com and we'll send instructions.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>What if an item arrives damaged?</summary><p>Send us a photo and we ship a replacement immediately. You don't need to return the damaged item.</p></details>\\n      <details><summary>Is there a product warranty?</summary><p>Yes. If a product fails under normal use, we replace it. We stand behind everything we manufacture.</p></details>\\n      <div class='box' style='margin-top:20px'><h3>Not sure which mat to pick?</h3><p class='microcopy'>1/8\\\" for travel and balance work · 1/4\\\" for everyday all-purpose practice · 1/2\\\" for joint sensitivity and restorative. Still unsure? Call us — we practice on these mats too.</p><a class='btn' href='/shop.html#mats'>Compare mats</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class='site'>\\n  <div class='wrap'>\\n    <div class='fgrid'>\\n      <div>\\n        <div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div>\\n        <p>Supplying the yoga community with mats, props and studio equipment direct from the source since 1999.</p>\\n        <p><b style='color:#fff'>1-800-555-9642</b><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET<br>help@yogadirect.com</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div><h4>Shop</h4><p><a href='/shop.html#mats'>Yoga mats</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; bricks</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; belts</a><br><a href='/shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a><br><a href='/shop.html#kits'>Kits &amp; bundles</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Business</h4><p><a href='/wholesale.html#quote'>Request a quote</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Studio fit-outs</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Logo printing</a><br><a href='/wholesale.html'>Schools &amp; Net-30</a></p></div>\\n      <div><h4>Help</h4><p><a href='/contact.html'>Contact us</a><br><a href='/contact.html#shipping'>Shipping info</a><br><a href='/contact.html#returns'>60-day returns</a></p></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Shop Pay</span></div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n<div class='stickycta'><a class='btn' href='tel:18005559642'>Call 1-800-555-9642</a><a class='btn gh' href='/shop.html'>Shop now</a></div>\\n<script>function sent(f){f.style.display=\\\"none\\\";document.getElementById(\\\"ok\\\").style.display=\\\"block\\\";return false}</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"}],\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Replaced the bare \\\"Featured Products\\\" page and wall of about-us text with a structured, benefit-led hero: a specific headline (\\\"direct from the maker — for a fraction of studio-brand prices\\\"), supporting proof points, and two clear CTAs (Shop best sellers / Get a bulk quote).\",\"Why\":\"Visitors previously landed on a page with no value proposition, no visible product, and no obvious next step. A clear above-the-fold promise plus one primary and one secondary CTA is the single biggest driver of first-click and add-to-cart rates.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a persistent announcement bar with the free-shipping threshold ($75), bulk-savings link, and 60-day returns, plus a trust strip (25+ years, 2M+ mats shipped, same-day dispatch, free returns).\",\"Why\":\"Shipping cost and return risk are the top causes of ecommerce abandonment. Stating them upfront removes objections early and the threshold nudges larger baskets.\"},{\"What\":\"Built real merchandising: best-seller product cards with images/color blocks, star ratings, review counts, price anchoring (was-price + % saved), and one-click Add to cart, plus a full shop page with mats, props and 240+ product framing.\",\"Why\":\"An ecommerce homepage without visible products and prices cannot convert. Social proof (ratings) and price anchoring increase click-through and perceived value.\"},{\"What\":\"Introduced a working mini-cart drawer with a free-shipping progress bar (\\\"Add $X more for free shipping\\\"), toasts on add-to-cart, and a persistent cart count.\",\"Why\":\"Immediate feedback after adding to cart reduces confusion, and the progress bar is a proven AOV lever that pushes orders over the free-shipping threshold.\"},{\"What\":\"Created a dedicated Wholesale &amp; Bulk landing page and an on-homepage bulk lead-capture form, with transparent volume pricing tiers, Net-30/PO terms, free logo printing, a 4-step process, and a \\\"quote in ~1 business hour\\\" promise.\",\"Why\":\"Studios, schools and events are the highest-value buyers for a supplier like YogaDirect. Capturing these leads with clear tier pricing and low-friction forms turns high-intent B2B traffic into large recurring orders instead of bounces.\"},{\"What\":\"Added bundles/kits (Home Practice, Restorative, Studio Starter) with per-bundle savings shown and a highlighted \\\"most popular\\\" option.\",\"Why\":\"Bundling raises average order value, simplifies decisions for beginners, and the decoy/highlight pattern steers buyers to the higher-margin mid-tier.\"},{\"What\":\"Added social proof throughout: 4.8/5 from 9,400+ reviews, \\\"trusted by 12,000+ studios since 1999\\\", named customer testimonials, and customer-type logos/segments.\",\"Why\":\"For an unfamiliar direct-to-consumer brand, credibility is the main conversion barrier; specific, attributed proof increases trust and reduces price skepticism.\"},{\"What\":\"Added objection-handling FAQ sections (shipping cost/speed, returns, bulk discounts, logo printing, damaged goods) on the home, wholesale and contact pages.\",\"Why\":\"Answering purchase-blocking questions on-page prevents drop-off to support channels or competitors and improves SEO for long-tail queries.\"},{\"What\":\"Added email capture with a 10%-off first-order incentive, both inline and as a delayed, dismissible modal that respects prior dismissal.\",\"Why\":\"Most first-time visitors do not buy on day one; a discount-for-email exchange builds a remarketable list and lifts first-purchase conversion.\"},{\"What\":\"Added visible contact points (phone number in the header, dedicated contact page with call/email/bulk paths and response-time promises) and a mobile sticky CTA bar.\",\"Why\":\"Displayed phone support and human response times reduce perceived risk for high-consideration and B2B purchases, while the sticky mobile bar keeps the primary action reachable on the device where most traffic converts.\"},{\"What\":\"Rebuilt the pages with mobile-first responsive layouts, semantic headings, descriptive title/meta/OG tags, internal linking between shop/wholesale/help, and lightweight inline CSS/JS (no heavy dependencies).\",\"Why\":\"Faster, crawlable, mobile-friendly pages improve both organic acquisition and conversion — every 100ms of latency and every mis-sized tap target costs revenue.\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"The fetch didn't return much content, so I want to try again or check some subpages to get a better sense of the site's structure.Since I only have the homepage content to work with, I'll design an improved version based on what's known—a yoga mat and props supplier since 1999 serving studios and events with bulk/wholesale options. I'll build the homepage plus a few plausible supporting pages like wholesale, collections, and contact, keeping things grounded in what I actually know rather than inventing specific products or prices.\n\nI'll focus on structuring the page with a sticky announcement bar, header with search and cart, a strong hero section, trust indicators like founding year and shipping thresholds, a best-sellers grid, and a bulk/studio quote form since that's likely a key revenue driver for this business.\n\nNow I'm outlining the design direction—warm teal and sand tones with a coral CTA accent—and listing the conversion elements to build into the homepage: a hero with clear value prop, a free shipping banner, trust signals like \"since 1999\" and review counts, and a best-sellers section with pricing and ratings.\n\nI'm also planning a wholesale lead-capture form, product bundles for higher order value, an email signup with a discount incentive, an FAQ section covering shipping and returns, and a sticky mobile CTA with cart drawer feedback. I want to add a lightweight JS-powered mini-cart using localStorage, complete with an add-to-cart toast and a free shipping progress indicator. Now I'm defining the root CSS variables for the color palette and starting the header navigation markup.\n\nFor the quote form, I'll wire up a placeholder action with JavaScript to display a thank-you message on submit. Moving into the main HTML structure, I'm laying out the announcement bar, header, and hero section with a two-column copy-and-image layout, weighing whether to use CSS gradients and inline SVG shapes for product visuals versus external Unsplash images, since broken images could hurt conversion but real photos help sell the product.\n\nI'm settling on tasteful CSS-and-SVG art instead of external photos to keep things reliable, and now I'm drafting the actual product catalog: a deluxe yoga mat, cork block, cotton strap, bolster, a bulk studio starter kit, and a yoga wheel, each with pricing, ratings, and review counts, alongside category groupings like mats, blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets, and studio bundles.\n\nTo avoid quoting headaches in the JSON output, I'm deciding to use single quotes for HTML attributes and double quotes inside embedded JavaScript. Now I'm writing the mini cart script...\n\nI'll add the cart drawer markup, toast notifications, and an email capture modal that appears after 12 seconds with a dismissible localStorage flag, then plan out four pages total: index, wholesale, shop, and contact, keeping the navigation links consistent across them.\n\nThe shop page gets a grid of about a dozen products with visual filters, sorting, and a trust bar; the wholesale page covers benefits, a tiered pricing table, a quote form, and studio testimonials; the contact page has info, an FAQ, and a form. To keep things manageable I'm reusing one shared CSS block across all pages, starting with base resets and typography settings.\n\nAdding sticky header styles...\n\nAdding mobile responsiveness, product card with add-to-cart functionality, a sticky mobile bar for quick actions, and an FAQ accordion using native details elements. I'm also drafting a list of roughly ten improvement suggestions, keeping the overall output focused and efficient before writing the final version.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The fetch didn't return much content, so I want to try again or check some subpages to get a better sense of the site's structure.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":""},{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Since I only have the homepage content to work with, I'll design an improved version based on what's known—a yoga mat and props supplier since 1999 serving studios and events with bulk/wholesale options. I'll build the homepage plus a few plausible supporting pages like wholesale, collections, and contact, keeping things grounded in what I actually know rather than inventing specific products or prices.\n\nI'll focus on structuring the page with a sticky announcement bar, header with search and cart, a strong hero section, trust indicators like founding year and shipping thresholds, a best-sellers grid, and a bulk/studio quote form since that's likely a key revenue driver for this business.\n\nNow I'm outlining the design direction—warm teal and sand tones with a coral CTA accent—and listing the conversion elements to build into the homepage: a hero with clear value prop, a free shipping banner, trust signals like \"since 1999\" and review counts, and a best-sellers section with pricing and ratings.\n\nI'm also planning a wholesale lead-capture form, product bundles for higher order value, an email signup with a discount incentive, an FAQ section covering shipping and returns, and a sticky mobile CTA with cart drawer feedback. I want to add a lightweight JS-powered mini-cart using localStorage, complete with an add-to-cart toast and a free shipping progress indicator. Now I'm defining the root CSS variables for the color palette and starting the header navigation markup.\n\nFor the quote form, I'll wire up a placeholder action with JavaScript to display a thank-you message on submit. Moving into the main HTML structure, I'm laying out the announcement bar, header, and hero section with a two-column copy-and-image layout, weighing whether to use CSS gradients and inline SVG shapes for product visuals versus external Unsplash images, since broken images could hurt conversion but real photos help sell the product.\n\nI'm settling on tasteful CSS-and-SVG art instead of external photos to keep things reliable, and now I'm drafting the actual product catalog: a deluxe yoga mat, cork block, cotton strap, bolster, a bulk studio starter kit, and a yoga wheel, each with pricing, ratings, and review counts, alongside category groupings like mats, blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets, and studio bundles.\n\nTo avoid quoting headaches in the JSON output, I'm deciding to use single quotes for HTML attributes and double quotes inside embedded JavaScript. Now I'm writing the mini cart script...\n\nI'll add the cart drawer markup, toast notifications, and an email capture modal that appears after 12 seconds with a dismissible localStorage flag, then plan out four pages total: index, wholesale, shop, and contact, keeping the navigation links consistent across them.\n\nThe shop page gets a grid of about a dozen products with visual filters, sorting, and a trust bar; the wholesale page covers benefits, a tiered pricing table, a quote form, and studio testimonials; the contact page has info, an FAQ, and a form. To keep things manageable I'm reusing one shared CSS block across all pages, starting with base resets and typography settings.\n\nAdding sticky header styles...\n\nAdding mobile responsiveness, product card with add-to-cart functionality, a sticky mobile bar for quick actions, and an FAQ accordion using native details elements. I'm also drafting a list of roughly ten improvement suggestions, keeping the overall output focused and efficient before writing the final version.","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":1,"signature":""}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5687,"completion_tokens":43201,"total_tokens":48888,"cost":1.10846,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":1.10846,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.028435,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":1.080025},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3491,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0},"server_tool_use_details":{"web_search_requests":0}}}
