</div><div class='tiers'><table><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Your discount</th><th>Example: Deluxe Mat</th></tr><tr><td>1–5 units</td><td class='save'>—</td><td>$24.95 ea</td></tr><tr><td>6–11 units</td><td class='save'>10% off</td><td>$22.45 ea</td></tr><tr><td>12–24 units</td><td class='save'>15% off</td><td>$21.20 ea</td></tr><tr><td>25–49 units</td><td class='save'>20% off</td><td>$19.96 ea</td></tr><tr><td>50+ units</td><td class='save'>Custom quote</td><td>Best price — ask us</td></tr></table></div></div></div><section><div class='sech'><h2>Why buy direct from YogaDirect</h2><p>We manufacture and source our own goods — that is how we keep quality high and prices low.</p></div><div class='why'><div><i>🏭</i><b>We are the source</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#4b4a54'>Own manufacturing and sourcing means no reseller markup on any order size.</p></div><div><i>🕰️</i><b>25+ years of trust</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#4b4a54'>Serving the yoga community faithfully since 1999 — one of the largest US suppliers.</p></div><div><i>📚</i><b>Built for volume</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#4b4a54'>Deep inventory of mats and props so full-class quantities ship together, fast.</p></div><div><i>💬</i><b>Real humans</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14.5px;color:#4b4a54'>Talk to a yoga person, not a call center. Product advice before you buy.</p></div></div></section><section style='background:#f6f1e8'><div class='wrap'><div class='sech'><h2>Loved by teachers and studio owners</h2><p><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span> 4.8 average from thousands of orders</p></div><div class='grid3'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>We replaced every mat in our studio and still came in under budget. The bulk tier pricing made it an easy decision, and delivery was quick.</p><b>Marisol D.</b><small>Studio owner, Austin TX</small></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>I order blocks and straps for teacher trainings twice a year. Consistent quality, and someone always answers the phone with a real answer.</p><b>Dana R.</b><small>Yoga teacher &amp; YTT lead</small></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p>Bought 120 mats for a corporate wellness event. Quote came back same day and everything arrived labeled and ready to hand out.</p><b>Kevin M.</b><small>Events coordinator</small></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='kit'><div><span class='eyebrow'>Bundle &amp; save</span><h2>The Complete Practice Kit — $39.95</h2><ul><li>Deluxe 1/4\\\" yoga mat</li><li>Two foam yoga blocks</li><li>8ft cotton strap with D-ring</li></ul><p style='margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#4b4a54'>Bought separately: $54.80. You save $14.85 — and it ships free.</p><button class='btn add' data-n='Complete Practice Kit' data-p='39.95'>Add Kit to Cart</button></div><div class='heroart' style='min-height:240px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b5541f,#e2b98a)'>📦</div></div></div></section><section class='email'><div class='wrap'><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p>Join our list for restock alerts, studio buying guides and members-only bulk deals.</p><form class='inline' id='ef'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@yourstudio.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn' type='submit'>Send My 10% Code</button></form><p style='font-size:13px;color:#9d9ca6'>One or two emails a month. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><div id='eok'></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><div class='sech'><h2>Questions before you order?</h2></div><details><summary>How fast do orders ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day. Bulk and freight orders usually ship within 1–2 business days after quote approval.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an account for wholesale pricing?</summary><p>No. Tiered discounts apply automatically at 6, 12 and 25+ units. For 50+ units, custom SKUs or logo printing, request a quote and we will build it for you.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>30 days on unused items in original packaging. If a product arrives damaged or is not what you expected, contact us and we will make it right.</p></details><details><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>Yes — custom logo mats, blocks and bags are available on qualifying quantities. Ask about artwork requirements on the wholesale page.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer samples?</summary><p>Free samples are available on qualifying wholesale quotes so you can feel the material before committing to a full order.</p></details><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:26px'><a class='btn alt' href='/contact.html'>Talk to a Yoga Gear Specialist</a></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying the yoga community with mats and props direct from the manufacturer since 1999.</p><p><b style='color:#fff'>📞 1-800-555-1999</b><br>Mon–Fri, 9am–6pm ET</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Straps</a><a href='/shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; Blankets</a><a href='/shop.html#kits'>Studio Kits</a></div><div><h4>Wholesale</h4><a href='/wholesale.html'>Request a Quote</a><a href='/wholesale.html#tiers'>Bulk Pricing Tiers</a><a href='/wholesale.html#custom'>Custom Logo Printing</a><a href='/contact.html'>Schools &amp; Net-30</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href='/contact.html'>Contact Us</a><a href='/contact.html#ship'>Shipping</a><a href='/contact.html#returns'>Returns</a><a href='/about.html'>Our Story</a></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Free shipping over $75 · 30-day returns · Secure checkout</span></div></div></footer><div class='mobcta'><a class='btn sm' href='/shop.html'>Shop Best Sellers</a><a class='btn