 Yoga Mat</h3><div class='rev'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 1,240 reviews</div><div class='pp'>$24.95 <s>$32.95</s></div><small style='color:var(--ink2)'>13 colors &middot; 6P-free &middot; Studio favorite</small><button class='btn btn-dark btn-sm' onclick='addCart(event)'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='pimg' style='background:linear-gradient(140deg,#f6e6d8,#e3b184)'>&#129513;</div><div class='pbody'><h3>Foam Yoga Blocks (Pair)</h3><div class='rev'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 860 reviews</div><div class='pp'>$14.95 <s>$19.95</s></div><small style='color:var(--ink2)'>High-density &middot; 9x6x4 in</small><button class='btn btn-dark btn-sm' onclick='addCart(event)'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='pimg' style='background:linear-gradient(140deg,#e6e9f5,#b8c2de)'>&#129525;</div><div class='pbody'><h3>8 ft Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><div class='rev'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</span> 512 reviews</div><div class='pp'>$9.95</div><small style='color:var(--ink2)'>D-ring or cinch buckle</small><button class='btn btn-dark btn-sm' onclick='addCart(event)'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><span class='badge'>Staff pick</span><div class='pimg' style='background:linear-gradient(140deg,#f2ece0,#d5c69c)'>&#129681;</div><div class='pbody'><h3>Rectangular Bolster</h3><div class='rev'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 398 reviews</div><div class='pp'>$44.95</div><small style='color:var(--ink2)'>Cotton batting &middot; Removable cover</small><button class='btn btn-dark btn-sm' onclick='addCart(event)'>Add to Cart</button></div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:28px'><a class='btn btn-primary' href='/shop'>Shop All Products</a></div></div></section><section class='bulk'><div class='wrap bgrid'><div><span class='eyebrow' style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3);color:#fff'>Wholesale &amp; bulk</span><h2>Outfitting a studio, school, gym or event?</h2><p style='font-size:18px;color:#d6e4de'>Tell us what you need and a real person sends a firm quote &mdash; usually within one business day. No membership fee, no annual minimums.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Your discount</th><th>Shipping</th></tr><tr><td>10&ndash;24 units</td><td>15% off</td><td>Flat rate</td></tr><tr><td>25&ndash;99 units</td><td>20% off</td><td>Discounted freight</td></tr><tr><td>100+ units</td><td>25% off + custom logo options</td><td>Free freight</td></tr></table><p style='font-size:14px;color:#bcd0c9;margin-top:16px'>Net-30 terms available for schools, universities and government purchase orders.</p></div><form class='form' onsubmit='leadSent(event)'><h3 style='margin-bottom:4px'>Request a bulk quote</h3><p style='margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink2)'>Takes 60 seconds. No obligation.</p><label>Name</label><input required placeholder='Your name'><label>Work email</label><input required type='email' placeholder='you@studio.com'><label>What do you need?</label><select><option>Yoga mats</option><option>Blocks, straps &amp; props</option><option>Full studio outfit (mats + props)</option><option>Event / giveaway order</option><option>Custom logo printing</option></select><label>Approximate quantity</label><select><option>10&ndash;24</option><option>25&ndash;99</option><option>100&ndash;499</option><option>500+</option></select><button class='btn btn-primary' type='submit'>Send My Quote Request</button><p style='font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2);text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>We reply within 1 business day. We never share your details.</p></form></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>Loved by the yoga community since 1999</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country.</p></div><div class='quotes'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><p>We have re-ordered mats every year for our studio. Same quality, honest pricing, and the bulk quote came back the next morning.</p><b>Megan R.</b><small>Studio owner, Austin TX</small></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><p>Ordered 120 mats for a school wellness program. Freight was free, everything arrived on time and under budget.</p><b>David L.</b><small>PE department, public school district</small></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><p>My bolster and blocks feel like the ones at my studio but cost half as much. Shipping was quick too.</p><b>Priya S.</b><small>Home practitioner</small></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:10px'><div class='wrap'><div class='split'><div><h2>Not sure which mat thickness you need?</h2><p style='color:var(--ink2);font-size:17px'>1/8&quot; travels light. 1/4&quot; is the studio all-rounder. 1/2&quot; cushions knees and joints for restorative and therapeutic work. Our team will point you to the right one for your class or body &mdash; free.</p><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn btn-dark' href='/contact'>Ask Our Team</a><a class='btn btn-out' href='/shop'>Compare Mats</a></div></div><div><ul class='ticks' style='margin:0'><li>Independently tested 6P-free PVC and eco TPE options</li><li>Non-slip textures for hot yoga and sweaty hands</li><li>Custom logo printing available on bulk orders</li><li>Replacement covers and refills for bolsters</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:20px'><div class='wrap faq'><div class='sec-head'><h2>Questions, answered</h2></div><details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders leave our US warehouse in 1&ndash;2 business days. Most US addresses receive delivery in 3&ndash;6 business days. Bulk freight orders are scheduled with you directly.</p></details><details><summary>When is shipping free?</summary><p>Standard shipping is free on retail orders over $75. Bulk orders of 100+ units ship freight-free within the contiguous US.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a minimum for wholesale pricing?</summary><p>Discounts begin at 10 units of the same item. There is no membership fee and no annual minimum &mdash; order when you need to.</p></details><details><summary>What if I do not love it?</summary><p>Return unused items within 30 days for a refund. If a product arrives damaged, send a photo and we replace it &mdash; no return shipping needed.</p></details><details><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>Yes. Custom logo printing is available on orders of 100+ mats, with digital proofs before production. Ask for it in your quote request.</p></details><details><summary>Do you accept purchase orders?</summary><p>Yes. We work with schools, universities, hospitals, hotels and government buyers and offer Net-30 terms on approved POs.</p></details></div></section><section style='padding-top:10px'><div class='wrap'><div class='news'><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p style='color:var(--ink2);margin:0'>Join 40,000+ yogis for restock alerts, studio tips and subscriber-only bulk deals.</p><form onsubmit='subbed(event)'><input required type='email' placeholder='Enter your email'><button class='btn btn-primary' type='submit'>Send My 10% Code</button></form><small style='color:var(--ink2)'>One or two emails a month. Unsubscribe anytime.</small></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8fc0b0'>Direct</span></div><p>Faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999. We manufacture and source our own goods so we can offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices.</p><div class='pay'><span>VISA</span><span>MASTERCARD</span><span>AMEX</span><span>PAYPAL</span><span>PO / NET-30</span></div></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a hre