<span class='was'>$41.99</span></div><div class='note'>Joint-friendly cushioning</div><div style='margin-top:auto'><button class='btn full sm' onclick='addCart(1)'>Add to Cart</button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='dark' id='wholesale'><div class='container g2 grid' style='align-items:center'><div><span class='eyebrow' style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:#ffd9a8'>For studios, gyms, schools &amp; events</span><h2>Buy in bulk. Save up to 40%.</h2><p class='lead'>No membership, no minimum order fee, no reseller license required. Tell us what you need and a studio specialist sends a same-day quote with freight included.</p><div class='tiers'><div class='tier'><b>10%</b>6–11 units</div><div class='tier'><b>20%</b>12–47 units</div><div class='tier'><b>30%</b>48–99 units</div><div class='tier'><b>40%</b>100+ units</div></div><ul class='ticks' style='color:#cfdad8'><li>Custom logo printing on mats &amp; bags</li><li>Net-30 terms available for studios &amp; schools</li><li>Dedicated rep, one invoice, one delivery</li></ul></div><form class='box' onsubmit='return leadSent(event)'><h3>Get your free bulk quote</h3><p class='note'>Average reply time: under 2 business hours.</p><label for='n'>Name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Your name'><label for='e'>Work email</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='you@studio.com'><label for='t'>What do you need?</label><select id='t'><option>Yoga mats</option><option>Blocks, straps &amp; props</option><option>Bolsters &amp; blankets</option><option>Full studio outfit</option><option>Event / retreat giveaway</option></select><label for='q'>Approx. quantity</label><select id='q'><option>6–11</option><option>12–47</option><option>48–99</option><option>100+</option></select><button class='btn full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send me a quote →</button><p class='note' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>No obligation. We never share your details.</p><p id='ldone' style='display:none;color:#175551;font-weight:700;text-align:center'>Thank you! Your quote is on its way.</p></form></div></section><section><div class='container'><h2>Why 10,000+ studios buy direct from us</h2><div class='grid g4' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='quote'><h3>🏭 We make it ourselves</h3>Manufacturing and sourcing our own goods means high-quality gear without the retail markup.</div><div class='quote'><h3>⚡ Fast, real inventory</h3>In-stock items leave our US warehouse within 24 hours — no drop-ship delays.</div><div class='quote'><h3>🤝 Humans who practice</h3>Our team does yoga. Ask us what thickness, density or length actually works.</div><div class='quote'><h3>🛡️ 60-day guarantee</h3>Not right for your practice? Send it back within 60 days for a refund or swap.</div></div></div></section><section style='background:#f7f3ec'><div class='container'><h2>What customers say</h2><div class='grid g3' style='margin-top:24px'><div class='card'><div class='body'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“We ordered 60 mats and 40 blocks for our new location. The price beat every wholesaler we called, and the quality has held up through two years of hot classes.”</p><b>Daniel K.</b><span class='note'>Studio owner · Portland, OR</span></div></div><div class='card'><div class='body'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“I teach corporate classes and needed 25 mats fast. Ordered Monday, taught with them Thursday. The rep even helped me pick colors to match our branding.”</p><b>Priya S.</b><span class='note'>Yoga teacher · Chicago, IL</span></div></div><div class='card'><div class='body'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“Bought the 1/2\\\" mat for my knees. Wildly better than the big-box mat I had, and half the price of the boutique brands.”</p><b>Ellen M.</b><span class='note'>Home practitioner · Nashville, TN</span></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class='container g2 grid' style='align-items:center'><div class='ph' style='height:260px'>🙏</div><div><h2>From our team of Yoga lovers to you</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p><a class='btn alt' href='/pages/about'>Read our story</a></div></div></section><section class='dark'><div class='container' style='max-width:720px;text-align:center'><h2>Take 10% off your first order</h2><p class='lead'>Join 90,000 practitioners who get first access to new gear, restocks and studio-only deals.</p><form onsubmit='return leadSent(event,\\\"sdone\\\")' style='display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' style='max-width:320px'><button class='btn'>Get my 10% code</button></form><p class='note' id='sdone' style='display:none;color:#ffd9a8;font-weight:700'>Check your inbox — code WELCOME10 is ready to use.</p><p class='note' style='color:#8fa3a0'>One email a week, unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></section><section><div class='container' style='max-width:840px'><h2>Questions, answered</h2><details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse; everything else ships within 24 hours. Most orders arrive in 2–5 business days.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a business license for wholesale pricing?</summary><p>No. Volume discounts start at 6 units and apply automatically at checkout. For 48+ units, <a href='/pages/wholesale' style='color:#175551;font-weight:700'>request a quote</a> for freight-included pricing and Net-30 terms.</p></details><details><summary>Which mat thickness should I choose?</summary><p>1/8\\\" for travel and strong standing balance, 1/4\\\" for the best all-round grip and cushion (our best seller), and 1/2\\\" for sensitive knees, restorative and therapy work.</p></details><details><summary>Can you print our studio logo?</summary><p>Yes — we print logos on mats, bags, towels and blocks at 25 units and up. Ask for a proof with your quote.</p></details><details><summary>What if I don't like it?</summary><p>Return any unused item within 60 days for a full refund or exchange. Studios can request a sample before placing a large order.</p></details></div></section><footer><div class='container'><div class='fgrid'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying the yoga community with mats, props and studio gear since 1999.</p><a class='btn sm' href='/pages/wholesale'>Get bulk pricing</a></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><p><a href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Yoga mats</a><br><a href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Blocks &amp; straps</a><br><a href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Bolsters &amp; cushions</a><br><a href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Blankets &amp; towels</a><br><a href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Studio kits</a></p></div><div><h4>Help</h4><p><a href='/pages/contact'>Contact us</a><br><a href='/pages/contact'>Shipping info</a><br><a href='/pages/contact'>60-day returns</a><br><a href='/pages/contact'>Order tracking</a><br><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Wholesale FAQ</a></p></div><div><h4>Company</h4><p><a href='/pages/about'>Our story</a><br><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Studios &amp; schools</a><br><a href='/pages/about'>Sustainability</a><br><a href='/pages/contact'>Careers</a></p></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Shop Pay</span></div></div></footer><div class='sticky'><a class='btn' style='flex:1' href='/collections/yoga-mats'>Shop Best Sellers</a><a class='btn alt' href='/pages/wholesale'>Bulk Quote</a></div><div id='toast'>Added to cart ✓</div><script>function addCart(n){var c=document.querySelectorAll('.cc');var v=parseInt(c[0].textContent||0)+(n||1);c.forEach(function(e){e.textContent=v});var t=document.getElementById('toast');if(t){t.style.display='block';clearTimeout(window._t);window._t=setTimeout(function(){t.style.display='none'},2500)}}function leadSent(ev,id){ev.preventDefault();var d=document.getElementById(id||'ldone');if(d)d.style.display='block';ev.target.querySelector('button').textContent='Sent ✓';return false}</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/collections/yoga-mats\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Shop Yoga Mats &amp; Props — YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Shop yoga mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and studio kits direct from the manufacturer. Volume discounts from 6 units, free shipping over $75, 60-day returns.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#14211f;background:#fff;line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.bar{background:#175551;color:#fff;font-size:13px;text-align:center;padding:9px 16px}.bar b{color:#ffd9a8}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:14px 20px}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.5px}.logo span{color:#e2653c}.menu{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-left:10px}.menu a:hover{color:#175551}.grow{flex:1}.search{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #e5ded3;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 12px;background:#faf8f4;min-width:210px}.search input{border:0;background:none;outline:none;font-size:14px;width:100%