or a refund or exchange \\\\u2014 no restocking fees.</p></div><div><span>\\\\ud83e\\\\udd1d</span><h3>Real people, real support</h3><p>Talk to a gear specialist who teaches. We help you spec the right props for your space and budget.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='sec-head'><h2>What the yoga community says</h2><div class='stars' style='font-size:16px'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 4.8 average from 12,400+ verified buyers</div></div><div class='grid3'><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><p>\\\\u201cWe re-matted all three of our studio rooms for less than we used to spend on one. Quote came back the next morning and freight was free.\\\\u201d</p><b>Marisa T. \\\\u2014 studio owner, Austin TX</b></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><p>\\\\u201cOrdered 60 blocks and 60 straps for teacher training. Arrived in two days, quality is better than the big brands at half the price.\\\\u201d</p><b>Devon R. \\\\u2014 YTT director</b></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><p>\\\\u201cMy 1/2\\\\u201d mat saved my knees. I\\\\u2019ve had it three years and it still grips. Bought two more as gifts.\\\\u201d</p><b>Angela P. \\\\u2014 home practitioner</b></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><div class='cap'><div><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p>Join 60,000 practitioners and studio owners. Be first to hear about restocks, closeouts and bulk deals \\\\u2014 plus a 10% welcome code, instantly.</p></div><div><form class='f-row' id='nl'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn btn-primary' type='submit'>Send My 10% Code</button></form><div class='ok' id='nlok'>\\\\u2713 Check your inbox \\\\u2014 your 10% code is on the way.</div><p class='note'>One email a week, unsubscribe anytime. We never sell your data.</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap faq'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Questions before you order?</h2><div class='q'><h4>How fast will my order arrive? <i>+</i></h4><p>In-stock orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Most orders arrive in 2\\\\u20135 business days. Free ground shipping on orders over $99.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Do you offer wholesale or studio pricing? <i>+</i></h4><p>Yes. Discounts start at 5 units and reach up to 40% at 100+ units, with free freight on larger pallet orders. <a href='/wholesale.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>Request a quote</a> and we\\\\u2019ll reply within one business day. Net-30 terms available for approved studios and schools.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>What is your return policy? <i>+</i></h4><p>Return any unused item within 30 days for a full refund or exchange \\\\u2014 no restocking fee. Bulk orders can be inspected on arrival; we replace any damaged item free.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Are your mats latex-free and non-toxic? <i>+</i></h4><p>Our PER and TPE mats are latex-free, phthalate-free and 6P-free. Product pages list full material specs and certifications so you can order with confidence.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Can you print our studio logo on mats? <i>+</i></h4><p>Yes \\\\u2014 custom logo printing and custom colors are available on most mats and bags at 50+ units. Mention it in your quote request and we\\\\u2019ll send mockups.</p></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='f-g'><div><a class='logo' href='/index.html' style='color:#fff'><strong style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></strong><small style='color:#8fa39d'>Mats &amp; Props Since 1999</small></a><p>One of the country\\\\u2019s largest suppliers of yoga mats and props. Manufacturer-direct pricing for studios, schools, events and home practice.</p><a class='btn btn-primary btn-sm' href='/wholesale.html'>Get a Bulk Quote</a></di