orative, yin, pilates, stretching and floor work</li><li>Studios and gyms needing durable rental / loaner mats</li><li>Events, schools and corporate wellness programs</li></ul><a class='btn btn-ghost btn-sm' href='/wholesale.html'>Spec this mat for my studio</a></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>1,204 reviews \\\\u00b7 4.8 average</h2><div class='grid3' style='margin-top:26px'><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><p>\\\\u201cI have bad knees and this is the first mat that made kneeling poses comfortable. Grippy, thick, and the price is unbeatable.\\\\u201d</p><b>Angela P. \\\\u00b7 Verified buyer</b></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605</div><p>\\\\u201cBought 24 for our studio\\\\u2019s restorative room. Two years of daily classes and they still look new. Freight was free at that quantity.\\\\u201d</p><b>Marisa T. \\\\u00b7 Studio owner</b></div><div class='rev'><div class='stars'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2606</div><p>\\\\u201cThicker than I expected \\\\u2014 in a good way. Slight smell for a day, then gone. Shipped the same day I ordered.\\\\u201d</p><b>Chris D. \\\\u00b7 Verified buyer</b></div></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2 style='text-align:center'>Shipping, returns &amp; FAQs</h2><div class='q'><h4>When will it ship? <i>+</i></h4><p>Orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Standard delivery is 2\\\\u20135 business days; expedited options are available at checkout. Free ground shipping over $99.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Can I return it if it\\\\u2019s too thick or too heavy? <i>+</i></h4><p>Yes. Return any unused mat within 30 days for a refund or exchange \\\\u2014 no restocking fee. We\\\\u2019ll happily swap it for our 1/4\\\\u201d Classic Studio Mat.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Is it slippery for hot yoga? <i>+</i></h4><p>The closed-cell surface stays grippy for most practices, but for heavy sweat we recommend our Natural Cork &amp; Rubber Mat or adding a mat towel.</p></div><div class='q'><h4>Do you print studio logos? <i>+</i></h4><p>Yes \\\\u2014 single-color logo printing is available from 50 units with mockups before production. <a href='/wholesale.html' style='text-decoration:underline'>Request a custom quote</a>.</p></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='f-g'><div><a class='logo' href='/index.html'><strong style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></strong><small style='color:#8fa39d'>Mats &amp; Props Since 1999</small></a><p>Manufacturer-direct yoga gear for studios, schools, events and home practice.</p><a class='btn btn-primary btn-sm' href='/wholesale.html'>Get a Bulk Quote</a></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop.html'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; Bricks</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#props'>Straps &amp; Bolsters</a></li><li><a href='/shop.html#bundles'>Studio Bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/contact.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html#ship'>Shipping</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html#returns'>Returns</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale.html'>Net-30 terms</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Company</h4><ul><li><a href='/about.html'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='/about.html#quality'>Quality &amp; materials</a></li><li><a href='/contact.html'>Studio consultations</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='f-b'><span>\\\\u00a9 1999\\\\u20132025 YogaDirect.</span><span>Secure checkout \\\\u00b7 Purchase orders welcome</span></div></div></footer><div class='sticky' id='sb'><div class='sticky-in'><div><b>Deluxe Extra-Thick Mat 1/2\\\\u201d</b><div class='stars' style='font-size:13px'>\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605\\\\u2605 <small>4.8 (1,204)</small> \\\\u00b7 <span class='save' style='padding:2px 8px'>Save 36%</span></div></div><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px'><span 