op:28px;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#8fa19b}.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}.stars{color:#e8a33d}.sticky{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:70;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 16px;display:none;gap:12px;align-items:center;box-shadow:0 -8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:30px}.hgrid,.grid3,.grid4,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}nav.main{display:none}.sticky{display:flex}body{padding-bottom:72px}}</style></head><body><div class='abar'>Bulk quotes answered in <b>one business hour</b> (Mon–Fri 8–5 ET) &nbsp;•&nbsp; Volume pricing from just 10 units</div><header class='hd'><div class='wrap hdin'><a class='logo' href='/'>Yoga<i>Direct</i><small>SINCE 1999</small></a><nav class='main'><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters</a><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/collections/all#sale'>Sale</a></nav><div class='hdr'><a class='cart' href='/cart'>Cart · <span id='cc'>0</span></a></div></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap hgrid'><div><span class='eyebrow'>Wholesale &amp; bulk · 12,000+ studios served</span><h1>Outfit your whole studio for less than retail sells one room.</h1><p class='lead'>We're the manufacturer, not a reseller. Tell us what you need and a specialist emails your custom pricing within one business hour — no account, no minimum, no obligation.</p><ul class='ticks'><li>Volume discounts start at 10 units — up to 40% off retail</li><li>Net-30 terms for studios, schools, gyms &amp; municipalities</li><li>Custom logo printing on mats, blocks, straps &amp; towels</li><li>Palletized freight with scheduled delivery and lift-gate</li><li>Dedicated account rep — one phone number, real answers</li></ul><div class='grid4' style='margin-top:6px'><div class='stat'><b>28%</b>Average studio savings</div><div class='stat'><b>&lt;1 hr</b>Quote turnaround</div><div class='stat'><b>25 yrs</b>Supplying yoga pros</div><div class='stat'><b>4.8/5</b>9,300+ reviews</div></div></div><div><form class='form' data-fake data-ok='ok1' id='quoteform'><h2 style='font-size:24px'>Get your bulk quote</h2><p class='note'>Takes 60 seconds. A human replies — not an autoresponder.</p><div class='f2'><div><label for='n'>Full name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Alex Rivera'></div><div><label for='e'>Work email</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='alex@studio.com'></div></div><div class='f2'><div><label for='o'>Studio / organization</label><input id='o' placeholder='Riverbend Yoga'></div><div><label for='ph'>Phone (optional)</label><input id='ph' placeholder='(555) 123-4567'></div></div><div class='f2'><div><label for='t'>Organization type</label><select id='t'><option>Yoga studio</option><option>Gym / fitness center</option><option>School or university</option><option>Hotel / resort / spa</option><option>Corporate wellness</option><option>Event or retreat</option><option>Reseller / distributor</option></select></div><div><label for='q'>Estimated quantity</label><select id='q'><option>10–24 units</option><option>25–49 units</option><option>50–99 units</option><option>100–499 units</option><option>500+ units</option></select></div></div><label for='w'>What do you need?</label><textarea id='w' rows='3' placeholder='e.g. 40 x 6mm mats in charcoal, 20 block pairs, logo printed'></textarea><div class='f2'><div><label for='d'>Needed by</label><input id='d' placeholder='e.g. Sept 15'></div><div><label for='c'>Custom logo printing?</label><select id='c'><option>Not needed</option><option>Yes — send options</option><option>Maybe — show pricing</option></select></div></div><button class='btn g full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send my quote request</button><p class='note' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>Or call <b>(800) 555-9642</b> · Mon–Fri 8–5 ET. We never share your details.</p></form><div class='form' id='ok1' style='display:none;text-align:center'><h2 style='font-size:24px'>Request received ✓</h2><p>A YogaDirect specialist is preparing your pricing now and will email you within one business hour. Need it today? Call <b>(800) 555-9642</b>.</p><a class='btn o' href='/collections/all'>Browse the catalog while you wait</a></div></div></div></section><section id='tiers'><div class='wrap'><h2>Volume pricing at a glance</h2><p style='color:var(--mut)'>Sample tiers for our best-selling 6mm Pro Grip mat. Every product in our 500+ catalog has its own tiers — mix and match to hit them faster.</p><table class='tiers'><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price each</th><th>Savings vs. retail</th><th>Shipping</th></tr><tr><td>1–9</td><td>$29.95</td><td>25%</td><td>Free over $75</td></tr><tr><td>10–24</td><td>$24.95</td><td>37%</td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>25–99</td><td>$22.45</td><td>44%</td><td>Free</td></tr><tr><td>100–499</td><td>Quoted (from $19.95)</td><td>Up to 50%</td><td>Freight quoted</td></tr><tr><td>500+ / OEM</td><td>Factory-direct program</td><td>Best available</td><td>Container or freight</td></tr></table><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px'><a class='btn' href='#quoteform'>Get my exact pricing →</a><a class='btn o' href='/pages/contact'>Talk to a specialist</a></div></div></section><section id='custom' style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid3'><div class='quote'><h3 style='font-size:18px'>Custom logo printing</h3><p style='margin:0;color:var(--mut)'>Put your studio's mark on mats, blocks, straps and towels. Low 25-unit minimum, 2–3 week turnaround, free digital proof before we print.</p></div><div class='quote' id='terms'><h3 style='font-size:18px'>Net-30 &amp; PO friendly</h3><p style='margin:0;color:var(--mut)'>We invoice studios, school districts, universities and government buyers. W-9, insurance certificates and quotes for your procurement team on request.</p></div><div class='quote'><h3 style='font-size:18px'>Events &amp; retreats</h3><p style='margin:0;color:var(--mut)'>Outfitting 200 people for a festival or teacher training? We handle scheduled delivery, staging and even post-event buyback on qualifying orders.</p></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><h2>Studios that switched to buying direct</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“We re-mat four rooms every year with YogaDirect. Better pricing than any quote we've received, and the mats survive 30 classes a week.”</p><b>— Marisa L., Owner, Riverbend Yoga (3 locations)</b></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“Quoted in under an hour, delivered on a pallet exactly when promised for our 200-hour training. Zero drama.”</p><b>— Naomi R., Teacher Training Director</b></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“Our district bought 340 mats on a PO. The logo printing looked better than the proof and came in under budget.”</p><b>— Coach D. Alvarez, Public School District</b></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:880px'><h2>Wholesale FAQ</h2><details class='faq' open><summary>Is there a minimum order?</summary><p>No minimum to buy — volume pricing simply begins at 10 units of a product, and mixed carts count toward category tiers. Custom printing has a 25-unit minimum.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>How fast can you ship a large order?</summary><p>In-stock bulk orders typically leave within 1–2 business days; palletized freight arrives in 3–7 business days depending on region. Rush timelines? Say so in your request and we'll confirm before you commit.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Can I get samples first?</summary><p>Yes. We ship discounted sample units so you can feel grip and thickness before committing to a floor's worth. Ask for samples in your quote request.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you offer Net-30 terms?</summary><p>We do, for established studios, schools, gyms and government buyers after a quick credit application. Your rep can also accept POs and provide W-9s and COIs.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>What if a bulk order isn't right?</summary><p>Unused bulk items can be returned within 60 days, and defects are replaced free. Custom-printed items are non-returnable, which is why we always send a proof first.</p></details></div></section><div class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2>Ready for direct pricing?</h2><p>Send your list and get real numbers within one business hour. No account, no obligation.</p><a class='btn' href='#quoteform'>Get my bulk quote →</a><p class='note' style='color:#8fa19b;margin-top:14px'>Prefer to talk? (800) 555-9642 · sales@yogadirect.com</p></div></div><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' style='color:#fff' href='/'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fc0ac'>Direct</i><small style='color:#8fa19b'>SINCE 1999</small></a><p style='margin-top:14px;max-width:320px'>One of the country's largest suppliers of yoga mats and props — we manufacture and source our own goods.</p><p><b style='color:#fff'>Talk to a human:</b><br>(800) 555-9642 · Mon–Fri 8–5 ET<br><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Studio &amp; Bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='#quoteform'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='#tiers'>Pricing tiers</a></li><li><a href='#custom'>Custom printing</a></li><li><a href='#terms'>Net-30 terms</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/contact'>Contact</a></li><li><a href='/pages/about'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='/cart'>Your cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. · Free shipping $75+ · 60-day returns</div></div></footer><div class='sticky'><div style='font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2'>Quotes in<br>&lt;1 business hour</div><a class='btn sm' style='flex:1;padding:12px 18px;font-size:14px' href='#quoteform'>Get bulk pricing</a></div><script>var K='yd_cart';function gc(){try{return parseInt(localStorage.getItem(K)||'0',10)||0}catch(e){return 0}}var el=document.getElementById('cc');if(el)el.textContent=gc();document.addEventListener('submit',function(e){var f=e.target;if(f.hasAttribute('data-fake')){e.preventDefault();var ok=document.getElementById(f.getAttribute('data-ok'));f.style.display='none';if(ok)ok.style.display='block';window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(0,(ok?ok.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.pageYOffset-120:0)),behavior:'smooth'})}});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/pages/about/index.html\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Our Story — Supplying the Yoga Community Since 1999 | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Since 1999 YogaDirect has grown into one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We manufacture and source our own goods so you get quality gear at direct prices.'><style>:root{--g:#14584a;--g2:#1f7a63;--acc:#e0704f;--ink:#1b2320;--mut:#5d6b66;--bg:#fffdf8;--line:#e9e3d8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-1px}h2{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.5px}p{margin:0 0 16px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.abar{background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:600}.abar b{color:#ffd6a6}header.hd{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(255,253,248,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hdin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:12px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.logo i{color:var(--g2);font-style:normal}.logo small{display:block;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:2.2px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:700}nav.main{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.hdr{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}.cart{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;background:#fff}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:15px 28px;font-size:16px;background:var(--acc);color:#fff;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(224,112,79,.28);font-family:inherit}.btn.o{background:#fff;color:var(--g);border:2px solid var(--g);box-shadow:none}.hero{background:radial-gradient(800px 380px at 80% 0,#eaf3ee,transparent),linear-gradient(180deg,#fffdf8,#fdf7ee);padding:46px 0}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:40px;align-items:center}.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--mut)}section{padding:50px 0}.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.grid4{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px}.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}.stat b{display:block;font-size:26px;color:var(--g)}.tl{border-left:3px solid #d9e6e0;padding-left:22px;margin-left:6px}.tl div{position:relative;margin-bottom:22px}.tl div:before{content:'';position:absolute;left:-31px;top:6px;width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--g2)}.tl b{color:var(--g)}.band{background:var(--g);color:#fff;text-align:center}.band .wrap{padding:50px 20px}.band h2{color:#fff}.band p{color:#d5e6e0}.quote{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--g2);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;font-size:15px}.quote b{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mut)}.imgbox{aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#14584a,#5f9f8b);display:grid;place-items:center}.imgbox svg{width:60%}footer{background:#12211d;color:#c9d5d0;padding:46px 0 26px;font-size:14.5px}footer a{color:#c9d5d0}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:28px}footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}footer ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}footer li{margin-bottom:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #24352f;margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:#8fa19b}.stars{color:#e8a33d}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:30px}.two,.grid3,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid4{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}nav.main{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class='abar'>Free shipping on orders $75+ &nbsp;•&nbsp; <b>Save 10%</b> with code <b>WELCOME10</b> &nbsp;•&nbsp; Serving the yoga community since 1999</div><header class='hd'><div class='wrap hdin'><a class='logo' href='/'>Yoga<i>Direct</i><small>SINCE 1999</small></a><nav class='main'><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters</a><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/collections/all#sale'>Sale</a></nav><div class='hdr'><a class='cart' href='/cart'>Cart · <span id='cc'>0</span></a></div></div></header><section class='hero'><div class='wrap two'><div><h1>From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</h1><p class='lead'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999, and we're confident we can help you grow your studio, your event or your personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/collections/all'>Shop the catalog</a><a class='btn o' href='/pages/wholesale'>Get studio pricing</a></div></div><div class='imgbox'><svg viewBox='0 0 120 90' aria-hidden='true'><rect x='10' y='34' width='70' height='28' rx='14' fill='#fff' opacity='.45'/><circle cx='26' cy='48' r='10' fill='#fff' opacity='.85'/><rect x='86' y='38' width='22' height='22' rx='5' fill='#fff' opacity='.55'/></svg></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:34px'><div class='wrap'><div class='grid4'><div class='stat'><b>1999</b>Year we started shipping</div><div class='stat'><b>2M+</b>Mats &amp; props delivered</div><div class='stat'><b>12,000+</b>Studios &amp; schools served</div><div class='stat'><b>4.8/5</b><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span> 9,300+ reviews</div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:10px'><div class='wrap two'><div><h2>Why we can charge less</h2><p>We manufacture and source our own goods. That single fact is why we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices — there's no distributor, no licensing fee and no retail markup sitting between our factory and your studio floor.</p><p>It also means we control quality. When a mat needs more grip or a bolster needs a tougher cover, we change the spec instead of waiting for a brand to do it. Every product we sell is one we'd put under our own knees.</p><h2 style='margin-top:26px'>What you're part of</h2><p>When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud knowing you're helping to grow not only your business or personal practice, but the yoga community as a whole — the teachers, the trainings, the community classes and the beginners rolling out a mat for the very first time.</p></div><div><div class='card'><h3 style='font-size:20px'>25 years, one focus</h3><div class='tl'><div><b>1999</b> — YogaDirect opens with a small line of mats for local studios.</div><div><b>2006</b> — We move to manufacturer-direct sourcing, cutting prices for studios by a third.</div><div><b>2013</b> — Warehouse expansion enables same-day dispatch on in-stock orders.</div><div><b>2018</b> — Custom logo printing launches with a low 25-unit minimum.</div><div><b>Today</b> — 500+ products, 12,000+ studio customers, and a team that still practices daily.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap'><h2>What our customers say</h2><div class='grid3'><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“Same quality, same fair prices, for over a decade of reorders.”</p><b>— Karen S., home practitioner</b></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“They helped us open two new rooms on a tight budget without cheap gear.”</p><b>— Marisa L., studio owner</b></div><div class='quote'><span class='stars'>★★★★★</span><p style='margin:8px 0 0'>“Somebody knowledgeable answers the phone. That's rare now.”</p><b>— Coach D. Alvarez, school district</b></div></div></div></section><div class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2>Let's grow your practice</h2><p>Shop 500+ in-stock products, or get custom studio pricing in one business hour.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/collections/all'>Shop best sellers</a><a class='btn o' href='/pages/wholesale'>Request a bulk quote</a></div></div></div><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' style='color:#fff' href='/'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fc0ac'>Direct</i><small style='color:#8fa19b'>SINCE 1999</small></a><p style='margin-top:14px;max-width:320px'>Supplying the yoga community with mats and props at manufacturer-direct prices since 1999.</p><p><b style='color:#fff'>Talk to a human:</b><br>(800) 555-9642 · Mon–Fri 8–5 ET<br><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#sale'>Clearance</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Studio &amp; Bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale#tiers'>Pricing tiers</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale#custom'>Custom printing</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/contact'>Contact</a></li><li><a href='/pages/contact#shipping'>Shipping</a></li><li><a href='/pages/contact#returns'>Returns</a></li><li><a href='/cart'>Your cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. · Free shipping $75+ · 60-day returns</div></div></footer><script>try{var n=parseInt(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'0',10)||0;var e=document.getElementById('cc');if(e)e.textContent=n}catch(e){}</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/pages/contact/index.html\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Contact YogaDirect — Real Humans, Fast Answers</title><meta name='description' content='Questions about yoga mats, props, shipping, returns or bulk pricing? Call (800) 555-9642 Mon–Fri 8–5 ET, email sales@yogadirect.com, or send us a message.'><style>:root{--g:#14584a;--g2:#1f7a63;--acc:#e0704f;--ink:#1b2320;--mut:#5d6b66;--bg:#fffdf8;--line:#e9e3d8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.9px}h2{font-size:26px}p{margin:0 0 14px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.abar{background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:600}.abar b{color:#ffd6a6}header.hd{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(255,253,248,.96);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hdin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:12px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px}.logo i{color:var(--g2);font-style:normal}.logo small{display:block;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:2.2px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:700}nav.main{display:flex;gap:18px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.hdr{margin-left:auto}.cart{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;background:#fff}.btn{display:inline-block;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;border-radius:999px;padding:15px 28px;font-size:16px;background:var(--acc);color:#fff;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(224,112,79,.28);font-family:inherit}.btn.g{background:var(--g);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(20,88,74,.22)}.btn.o{background:#fff;color:var(--g);border:2px solid var(--g);box-shadow:none}.btn.full{display:block;width:100%}section{padding:44px 0}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;margin-bottom:16px}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:6px}.form{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(28,35,33,.07)}.form label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:10px 0 5px}.form input,.form select,.form textarea{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-family:inherit;background:#fffdf8}.f2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.faq{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:15px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq summary:after{content:'+';color:var(--g2);font-weight:800}.faq[open] summary:after{content:'–'}.faq p{color:var(--mut);padding-bottom:8px}.note{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}.band{background:var(--g);color:#fff;text-align:center}.band .wrap{padding:46px 20px}.band h2{color:#fff}.band p{color:#d5e6e0}footer{background:#12211d;color:#c9d5d0;padding:44px 0 24px;font-size:14.5px}footer a{color:#c9d5d0}.fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:28px}footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 12px}footer ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}footer li{margin-bottom:8px}.fbot{border-top:1px solid #24352f;margin-top:26px;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:#8fa19b}@media(max-width:900px){h1{font-size:28px}.two,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav.main{display:none}}</style></head><body><div class='abar'>Bulk quotes answered in <b>one business hour</b> &nbsp;•&nbsp; Free shipping on orders $75+</div><header class='hd'><div class='wrap hdin'><a class='logo' href='/'>Yoga<i>Direct</i><small>SINCE 1999</small></a><nav class='main'><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; Props</a><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters</a><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/collections/all#sale'>Sale</a></nav><div class='hdr'><a class='cart' href='/cart'>Cart · <span id='cc'>0</span></a></div></div></header><section><div class='wrap two'><div><h1>Talk to someone who actually practices yoga.</h1><p style='color:var(--mut);font-size:17px'>Not sure which mat suits your floor, your students or your knees? Need a rush order or a purchase order? We answer fast — Mon–Fri, 8–5 ET.</p><div class='card'><h3>📞 Call us: (800) 555-9642</h3><p class='note' style='margin:0'>Average hold time under 90 seconds. Mon–Fri 8am–5pm ET.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>✉️ Email: sales@yogadirect.com</h3><p class='note' style='margin:0'>Replies within one business hour during office hours.</p></div><div class='card'><h3>🏷️ Bulk &amp; wholesale</h3><p style='margin:0 0 10px'>Studios, schools, gyms, hotels and events — get tiered pricing and freight quotes.</p><a class='btn g' href='/pages/wholesale'>Request a bulk quote →</a></div><div class='card'><h3>📦 Order &amp; return help</h3><p class='note' style='margin:0'>Have your order number handy and we can track, exchange or replace in one call. 60-day return window on everything unused.</p></div></div><div><form class='form' data-fake data-ok='cok'><h2 style='font-size:23px'>Send us a message</h2><p class='note'>We reply within one business hour, Mon–Fri 8–5 ET.</p><div class='f2'><div><label for='n'>Name</label><input id='n' required placeholder='Alex Rivera'></div><div><label for='e'>Email</label><input id='e' type='email' required placeholder='alex@email.com'></div></div><label for='t'>How can we help?</label><select id='t'><option>Product question (which mat is right for me?)</option><option>Bulk / wholesale pricing</option><option>Order status or shipping</option><option>Return or exchange</option><option>Custom logo printing</option><option>Something else</option></select><label for='o'>Order number (if applicable)</label><input id='o' placeholder='YD-123456'><label for='m'>Message</label><textarea id='m' rows='5' placeholder='Tell us what you need and when you need it.'></textarea><button class='btn g full' style='margin-top:16px'>Send message</button><p class='note' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>Need an answer now? Call (800) 555-9642.</p></form><div class='form' id='cok' style='display:none;text-align:center'><h2 style='font-size:23px'>Message sent ✓</h2><p>Thanks — we'll reply within one business hour during office hours. For anything urgent, call <b>(800) 555-9642</b>.</p><a class='btn o' href='/collections/all'>Keep shopping</a></div></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:900px'><h2>Quick answers</h2><details class='faq' id='shipping' open><summary>Shipping: how fast and how much?</summary><p>In-stock orders placed before 2pm ET ship the same business day. Standard US shipping is free over $75 and starts at $7.95 below that. Most deliveries arrive in 2–5 business days; expedited and freight options are available at checkout or by quote.</p></details><details class='faq' id='returns'><summary>Returns: what's the policy?</summary><p>60 days on unused items, bulk orders included. Contact us with your order number for a return label or exchange. Defective items are replaced free. Custom-printed goods are final sale — we always send a proof first.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Which mat should I buy?</summary><p>6mm Pro Grip is our best seller and studio standard. Choose 3mm for travel, 10mm for extra cushioning, and cork or jute for eco-friendly grip. Tell us your style of practice and we'll recommend one in a single reply.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Do you offer Net-30 or accept POs?</summary><p>Yes — for studios, schools, universities and government buyers. Ask your rep for a credit application, W-9 or certificate of insurance.</p></details><details class='faq'><summary>Where do you ship from?</summary><p>Our own US warehouse, which is why same-day dispatch and quick freight scheduling are possible. We also ship to Canada — request a quote for international rates.</p></details></div></section><div class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2>Ready when you are</h2><p>Shop 500+ in-stock products, or get studio pricing in one business hour.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap'><a class='btn' href='/collections/all'>Shop best sellers</a><a class='btn o' href='/pages/wholesale'>Get bulk pricing</a></div></div></div><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' style='color:#fff' href='/'>Yoga<i style='color:#7fc0ac'>Direct</i><small style='color:#8fa19b'>SINCE 1999</small></a><p style='margin-top:14px;max-width:320px'>Mats and props at manufacturer-direct prices since 1999.</p><p><b style='color:#fff'>(800) 555-9642</b><br>Mon–Fri 8–5 ET<br><a href='mailto:sales@yogadirect.com'>sales@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/collections/all#mats'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#props'>Blocks &amp; props</a></li><li><a href='/collections/all#bolsters'>Bolsters</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Studio &amp; Bulk</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/wholesale'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='/pages/wholesale#tiers'>Pricing tiers</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/pages/about'>Our story</a></li><li><a href='#shipping'>Shipping</a></li><li><a href='#returns'>Returns</a></li><li><a href='/cart'>Your cart</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'>© 2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer><script>try{var n=parseInt(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'0',10)||0;var e=document.getElementById('cc');if(e)e.textContent=n}catch(e){}document.addEventListener('submit',function(e){var f=e.target;if(f.hasAttribute('data-fake')){e.preventDefault();var ok=document.getElementById(f.getAttribute('data-ok'));f.style.display='none';if(ok)ok.style.display='block'}});</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/cart/index.html\",\"html\":\"<!doctype html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Your Cart | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Review your YogaDirect cart. Free shipping over $75, same-day dispatch before 2pm ET, 60-day returns, secure checkout.'><style>:root{--g:#14584a;--g2:#1f7a63;--acc:#e0704f;--ink:#1b2320;--mut:#5d6b66;--bg:#fffdf8;--line:#e9e3d8}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}h1,h2,h3{line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 12px}h1{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.7px}h2{font-size:22px}p{margin:0 0 12px}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.abar{background:var(--g);color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:600}.abar b{color:#ffd6a6}hea