 proud knowing you're helping grow not only your practice but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</p></section><section class='news'><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Join 100,000+ subscribers for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and practice tips.</p><form action='/subscribe' method='post'><input type='email' required placeholder='Enter your email address' aria-label='Email address'><button type='submit'>Get 10% Off</button></form></section><footer><div class='fgrid'><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href='/yoga-mats'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/yoga-bolsters'>Bolsters</a><a href='/yoga-blocks'>Blocks & Straps</a><a href='/sale'>Sale</a></div><div><h4>Support</h4><a href='/shipping'>Shipping & Returns</a><a href='/faq'>FAQ</a><a href='/contact'>Contact Us</a><a href='/track-order'>Track My Order</a></div><div><h4>Company</h4><a href='/about-us'>About Us</a><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale Program</a><a href='/reviews'>Customer Reviews</a></div><div><h4>Contact</h4><a href='tel:18007803858'>📞 1-800-780-3858</a><a href='mailto:support@yogadirect.com'>✉️ support@yogadirect.com</a><a href='/'>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm EST</a></div></div><div class='copy'>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. &nbsp;|&nbsp; 🔒 Secure SSL Checkout &nbsp;|&nbsp; Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal</div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/yoga-mats\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1'><title>Yoga Mats – Factory-Direct Quality from $12.95 | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Shop premium yoga mats direct from the manufacturer. Extra-thick, natural rubber, and studio bulk options. Free shipping over $75, 60-day returns.'><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2d2d2d;line-height:1.6}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.announce{background:#4a6741;color:#fff;text-align:center;p