yle></head><body><div class='announce'>🚚 FREE SHIPPING on orders over $75 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Take <b>10% OFF</b> your first order with code <b>WELCOME10</b> &nbsp;|&nbsp; 60-Day Easy Returns</div><header><a class='logo' href='/'>Yoga<span>Direct</span></a><div class='hdr-links'><a href='/wholesale'>Studio & Wholesale</a><a href='/account'>Account</a><a class='cart-btn' href='/cart'>🛒 Cart (0)</a></div></header><nav><a href='/yoga-mats'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/yoga-bolsters'>Bolsters</a><a href='/yoga-blocks'>Blocks</a><a href='/yoga-straps'>Straps</a><a href='/yoga-blankets'>Blankets</a><a href='/meditation'>Meditation</a><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale</a><a class='sale' href='/sale'>🔥 Sale</a></nav><section class='hero'><h1>From Our Team of Yoga Lovers to You</h1><p>Faithfully supplying the yoga community with quality gear at honest prices since 1999.</p></section><section class='sec'><h2>Our Story</h2><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more.</p><p>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. There's no middleman, no retail markup — just well-made gear at a fair price.</p><p>When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</p><div class='stats'><div><b>25+</b>Years in business</div><div><b>500K+</b>Happy customers</div><div><b>1000s</b>Studios supplied</div><div><b>4.8★</b>Average rating</div></div></section><section class='cta'><h2>Ready to Grow Your Practice?</h2><a class='btn' href='/yoga-mats'>Shop Best Sellers</a></section><footer><div class='fgrid'><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href=