 you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p></div></section><section class=\\\"section newsletter\\\" id=\\\"newsletter\\\"><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p class=\\\"sub\\\">Join our community for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and practice tips</p><form action=\\\"/newsletter-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button></form><small>No spam, ever. Unsubscribe anytime.</small></section><footer><div class=\\\"footer-grid\\\"><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Blocks & Straps</a><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a><a href=\\\"/meditation\\\">Meditation</a><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></div><div><h4>Help</h4><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">30-Day Returns</a><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></div><div><h4>Company</h4><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About Us</a><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale Program</a><a href=\\\"/reviews\\\">Customer Reviews</a></div><div><h4>We Promise</h4><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">🚚 Free Shipping Over $75</a><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">↩️ Easy 30-Day Returns</a><a href=\\\"/security\\\">🔒 Secure Checkout</a><a href=\\\"/about\\\">🌱 Serving Yogis Since 1999</a></div></div><div class=\\\"footer-bottom\\\">© 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. | <a href=\\\"/privacy\\\" style=\\\"color:#cfe3d7\\\">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href=\\\"/terms\\\" style=\\\"color:#cfe3d7\\\">Terms of Service</a></div></footer></body></html>\"}],\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a p