ffer stability for balance work, 1/4&quot; is our most popular all-purpose thickness, and 1/2&quot; extra-thick mats provide maximum cushioning for restorative practice or sensitive joints. Because we manufacture our own mats, every YogaDirect mat is tested for grip, durability, and safety — and priced far below comparable big-brand options. Questions? <a href='/contact' style='color:#1f6f5c;font-weight:700'>Our team of yoga lovers is happy to help.</a></p></div><footer><a href='/about'>About</a><a href='/contact'>Contact</a><a href='/shipping'>Shipping</a><a href='/returns'>Returns</a><a href='/wholesale'>Wholesale</a><div style='margin-top:14px;color:#8fa8a0'>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div></footer></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/wholesale\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='UTF-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1'><title>Wholesale & Bulk Yoga Supplies | Studio Discounts | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Bulk yoga mats, bolsters, blocks and blankets for studios, gyms, schools and events. Factory-direct wholesale pricing since 1999. Get a custom quote in one business day.'><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2d3a3a;line-height:1.6}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.announce{background:#1f6f5c;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:10px 16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e6ecea}.header-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 20px;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.logo{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#1f6f5c}.logo span{color:#e8a33d}nav ul{display:flex;list-style:none;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}nav a{font-weight:600;font-size:15px}nav a:hover{color:#1f6f5c}.hero{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#173f34,#1f6f5c);color:#fff;padding:64px 20px;text-a