[{\"What\":\"Added a prominent hero section with a clear value proposition ('Premium Yoga Gear, Factory-Direct Prices') and dual CTAs for retail shoppers and wholesale buyers.\",\"Why\":\"A strong above-the-fold headline and clear calls-to-action immediately communicate value and direct visitors to high-intent paths, significantly increasing click-through and conversion rates.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a sitewide announcement bar promoting free shipping over $50 and bulk discounts.\",\"Why\":\"Free shipping thresholds increase average order value, and surfacing wholesale offers at the top captures high-value B2B leads that might otherwise bounce.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a trust bar with social proof (4.8/5 rating, 12,000+ reviews), free shipping, easy returns, secure checkout, and 'Trusted Since 1999'.\",\"Why\":\"Trust signals near the top of the page reduce purchase anxiety and are proven to lift e-commerce conversion rates, especially for first-time visitors.\"},{\"What\":\"Created a 'Shop by Category' grid with starting prices for mats, blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets, and meditation gear.\",\"Why\":\"Clear category navigation with anchor pricing reduces friction, helps visitors self-segment quickly, and 'From $X' pricing encourages exploration by signaling affordability.\"},{\"What\":\"Rebuilt the Featured Products section with product cards showing star ratings, review counts, strikethrough pricing, savings percentages, and 'Best Seller'/'Sale' badges plus direct Add to Cart buttons.\",\"Why\":\"Ratings and review counts provide social proof, anchored discount pricing creates urgency and perceived value, and one-click add-to-cart shortens the purchase funnel — all key drivers of conversion and revenue.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a dedicated wholesale/bulk quote section targeting studios, gyms, and events.\",\"Why\":\"YogaDirect's copy emphasizes serving studios and events; a dedicated B2B lead-capture path converts high-value bulk buyers who generate much larger order values than individual shoppers.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a customer testimonials section with verified-buyer reviews from a studio owner, home practitioner, and event coordinator.\",\"Why\":\"Testimonials matching each key customer persona build credibility and address objections for each buying segment, increasing conversion across audiences.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a 100% satisfaction guarantee / 30-day return strip near the product listings.\",\"Why\":\"Risk-reversal guarantees placed near purchase decisions reduce hesitation and cart abandonment.\"},{\"What\":\"Added an email capture with a 10% first-order discount incentive.\",\"Why\":\"Discount-for-email offers convert 5-10x better than plain newsletter signups, building a remarketing list that drives repeat revenue.\"},{\"What\":\"Retained and repositioned the original brand story ('Why Shop YogaDirect?') with credibility stats (25+ years, 1M+ mats shipped, 10K+ studios).\",\"Why\":\"The heritage story builds emotional connection and trust, and quantified stats make the brand's scale and reliability tangible.\"},{\"What\":\"Added sticky header with search bar, phone number, account, and cart access, plus full category navigation.\",\"Why\":\"Persistent search and cart access reduce friction throughout the browsing session; a visible phone number builds trust and captures buyers who prefer to order by phone (common for bulk orders).\"},{\"What\":\"Added SEO meta title and description with high-intent keywords ('yoga mats, props & gear at wholesale prices', 'free shipping'), plus mobile-responsive design.\",\"Why\":\"Improved SEO metadata increases organic click-through from search results, and mobile responsiveness is essential since the majority of e-commerce traffic is mobile.\"},{\"What\":\"Added a comprehensive footer with shipping, returns, FAQ, and contact links.\",\"Why\":\"Easily findable policy and support links are trust prerequisites for hesitant buyers and reduce pre-purchase support inquiries.\"}]}","refu